# Rust / Cargo
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
# Cargo.lock is tracked on purpose: this is a binary crate.

# Local config written next to the executable.
# Holds printer IP, serial and LAN access code in plain text — never commit it.
/config.toml
/config.json
*.local.toml

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Agent / tooling state
/.claude/
CLAUDE.local.md
# Working notes, screenshots and helper scripts of a review pass. Local
# only: the publish recipe runs `git add -A`, and these would ride along.
/scratchpad/
# The design doc and the polish rulebook: working documents, kept on disk
# and out of the published tree. They are what main's curated recipe used
# to drop by hand. The screenshots the README shows live in assets/.
/docs/

# Release packaging
/dist/
/release/
*.zip
*.exe
*.msi

